SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE — 이 라이선스가 덮는 범위

The MIT grant above applies to the Waple project's own work: the Swift, Objective-C,
shell and Python sources, the tests, the build and verification tooling, and the
documentation authored in this repository.

It does NOT apply to third-party material that is redistributed here. In particular
it does NOT apply to:

  * Sources/WapleRender/Resources/WEAssets/
    2,940 files (~75.8 MB) copied verbatim from the `assets/` directory of a
    Wallpaper Engine 2.8.42 installation. These remain the property of their
    respective rights holders. Waple neither owns them nor is in a position to
    sublicense them, and nothing in the MIT text above should be read as granting
    you any right to copy, redistribute or sell them. See NOTICE §0 for provenance,
    file hashes and the technical reason they are bundled, and NOTICE §0.1 for the
    fonts contained within that tree, several of which carry their own licenses.

  * Any other file whose own header or accompanying license text states different
    terms; that text governs for that file.

If you redistribute Waple — source or binary — you are responsible for satisfying
the terms of the third-party material it carries. Removing the WEAssets tree makes
the build fail by design (scripts/package-app.sh), so this is a decision to make
deliberately rather than by accident.

